msgstr ""

#: ../../source/Crypto/Crypto.rst:80 80c24657a4c9445088459fff264379b2
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"CMake install rules export the ``crypto_api`` library, its public "
"headers, and a CMake package configuration. All CMake content sits at the"
" repository root: the CMake package template and the pkg-config template "
"are ``cmake/crypto_apiConfig.cmake.in`` and ``crypto_api.pc.in``. "
"Consumers use the CMake target ``crypto_api::crypto_api`` (or "
