msgstr ""
"CMake 설치 규칙은 ``crypto_api`` 라이브러리, 해당 공개 헤더 및 CMake 패키지 구성을 내보냅니다. 모든 "
"CMake 콘텐츠는 저장소 루트에 있습니다. CMake 패키지 템플릿과 pkg-config 템플릿은 "
"``cmake/crypto_apiConfig.cmake.in`` 및 ``crypto_api.pc.in``입니다."

#: ../../source/Crypto/Crypto.rst:89 dccd3901c8024859b9a9753e818d6692
msgid "Common API"
msgstr "공통 API"

#: ../../source/Crypto/Crypto.rst:91 c1b71e19c8f6422eabd99bd0997daae8
msgid ""
"Most public functions return ``pf_err_t``; ``PF_OK`` indicates success. "
"Functions that report a size or a string instead have their own return "
"type (``pf_err_string`` returns ``const char *``, "
"``pf_crypto_openssl_errors`` returns ``void``, ``pf_rsa_ciphertext_len`` "
"and ``pf_rsa_max_plaintext_len`` return ``size_t``, and the ``*_free`` "
"functions return ``void``). Use ``pf_err_string`` to convert an error "
"code to readable text and ``pf_crypto_openssl_errors`` to retrieve the "
"pending OpenSSL error queue."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/Crypto/Crypto.rst:114 67ae5556635e43a487c38bf8011e1c5b
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The library uses caller-provided output buffers for fixed-size results. "
"Functions that return allocated buffers document that the caller must "
"release them with ``pf_crypto_free`` — the library's own ``free``, so the"
" allocation and the deallocation always run on the same C runtime (a host"
" such as CPython on Windows may use a different one, and freeing across "
"runtimes corrupts the heap). Opaque key handles must be released with "
"their corresponding ``*_free`` function. HKDF output is capped at "
"``PF_CRYPTO_HKDF_SHA256_MAX_OUT`` (8160 bytes) by both "
"``pf_crypto_hkdf_sha256`` and ``pf_ecdh_derive_key``."
msgstr ""
"라이브러리는 고정 크기 결과를 위해 호출자가 제공한 출력 버퍼를 사용합니다. 할당된 버퍼를 반환하는 함수는 호출자가 이를 "
"``free``로 해제해야 함을 문서화합니다. 불투명 키 핸들은 해당 ``*_free`` 함수를 사용하여 해제해야 합니다."

#: ../../source/Crypto/Crypto.rst:125 69248ac47e7e47f18e953dee857db239
msgid "RSA API"
msgstr "RSA API"

#: ../../source/Crypto/Crypto.rst:127 a770dcc04e2c42d1be50fe30d298df4b
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"RSA keys are generated with ``pf_rsa_keygen``. The implementation uses "
"RSA-OAEP with SHA-256 for encryption and decryption. Key sizes from 2048 "
"to 16384 bits are accepted; 2048, 3072, or 4096 bits are recommended."
msgstr ""
"RSA 키는 ``ss_rsa_keygen``을 사용하여 생성됩니다. 구현에서는 암호화 및 암호 해독을 위해 SHA-256과 함께 "
"RSA-OAEP를 사용합니다. 2048~16384비트의 키 크기가 허용됩니다. 2048, 3072 또는 4096비트가 권장됩니다."

#: ../../source/Crypto/Crypto.rst:151 e7b876b8fb354b2da45d3c13f50ededf
msgid ""
"The first encryption call with ``out == NULL`` queries the required "
"output size; ``pf_rsa_decrypt`` supports the same query pattern. RSA "
"encryption is binary-safe (it accepts an explicit input length, embedded "
"NUL bytes included) and rejects inputs longer than the value returned by "
"``pf_rsa_max_plaintext_len`` with ``PF_ERR_INVALID_ARG``. "
"``pf_rsa_ciphertext_len`` returns the ciphertext size for a key (equal to"
" its modulus size in bytes), and ``pf_rsa_key_free`` releases a key "
"handle."
msgstr ""

